Package: minish
Version: 1.0.0
Section: shells
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: System Administrator <admin@localhost>
Description: Minimalist POSIX rescue and emergency administration shell
 minish is a lightweight, low-dependency shell designed as a fail-safe
 backup shell for system administration, container debugging, and disaster
 recovery. Operates with zero history disk persistence, minimal memory
 footprint, and built-in core utilities.
